|---|---|
| `neutral_identities_by_std_opt_algebra` | C++ 模式把五条全部改掉，dce 后只剩一个 add、没有 DATA |
| `neutral_identities_by_the_rule_library` | `rules::simplify` 对同五条给出同一个存活图：库确实有这些定律 |
| `neutral_identities_execution.nvm/fvm/jit/prl` | 四个后端上的值：`7 7 9223372036854775806 2147483646` |
| `neutral_mode_keeps_the_other_laws` | 模式保留 `mul/sub/div/neg` 四条：它不是 `simplify` |
| `the_library_simplifies_the_other_laws` | 同样的四条在库里会被改掉：差别在模式，不在定律 |
